 "description": "The formats to shoot this week: the week's picks, then the week's feed. The short-form formats breaking out now (TikTok, Reels, Shorts): this week's picks first \u2014 each with Shorti's line on the hit that broke out this week (`this_week.why`) and that hit's link \u2014 then the rest of the week's feed, in the order Shorti's home shows it. Each format says what its videos do, its strongest video (link, views, poster), how it has spread, its page and the check with it filled. Narrow by `category` (the creator's niche) and `platform`. Signed in, the person's own week leads (`for_you`: why each came to them). Use it when a creator or a brand asks what to make now; then shorti_format(format_id) for how to shoot one.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "category": {
    "anyOf": [
     {
      "enum": [
       "beauty",
       "food",
       "fashion",
       "daily",
       "comedy",
       "dance",
       "music",
       "pets",
       "fitness",
       "travel",
       "art",
       "gaming",
       "product",
       "info",
       "ai",
       "household",
       "tech",
       "parenting"
      ],
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "type": "null"
     }
    ],
    "default": null,
    "description": "The creator's niche, when they have one: beauty, food, fashion, daily, comedy, dance, music, pets, fitness, travel, art, gaming, product, info, ai, household, tech, parenting."
   },
   "lang": {
    "default": "ko",
    "description": "The creator's language. 'en' answers in the English Shorti wrote: never translate its Korean yourself.",
    "enum": [
     "ko",
     "en"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "default": 6,
    "description": "How many formats.",
    "maximum": 10,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "platform": {
    "anyOf": [
     {
      "enum": [
       "tiktok",
       "instagram",
       "youtube"
      ],
      "type": "string"
     },
     {
      "type": "null"
     }
    ],
    "default": null,
    "description": "Only formats with videos on this platform."
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
